window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Lonnie Skyborne's life has been defined by secrets and lies, but now that her mother has been found alive she's about to get some answers. Unfortunately in the royal court of Elsewhere, the truth won't always set you free.<br> <br> The Everlasts remain imprisoned by an ancient curse, and Lonnie, Bael, Scion, and Ambrose must figure out how to break it in order to finally get their happy ending.<br> <br> <i>Let the final hunt begin</i><br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
